Steam
-----

Steam Achievement Manager talks to the Steam client already installed on the
computer (steamclient64.dll). No Valve code is distributed with it. Steam and
the Steam logo are trademarks of Valve Corporation.


Online services
---------------

Game names and images come from the Steam client and Valve's CDN; the list of
games from gib.me; achievement groups (DLC sections) from steamhunters.com;
and, when "Show the game in Discord" is on, the list of games Discord detects
from discord.com. No data of these services is distributed with the program.
